~ start
do start_talking()
do disable_movement()
NPCBlacksmith: [[Hi|Hello|Hey]] there visitor, welcome to our world! Have you seen our vast forests?
- Yes, they seem mystical!
	NPCBlacksmith: They do indeed, [[be careful around the fragile trees - they could break and hurt you!|enjoy the exploration!|there's always more to see!]].
- No, I have not
	NPCBlacksmith: You should go check it out, the forest is full of surprises.
	NPCBlacksmith: To truly explore these, you would need an [wave]axe[/wave]. Let me see if I have a spare lying around.
	NPCBlacksmith: [wait=1] Ahaa! Here take this one, it is a bit rusty but should get the job done for the smaller trees!
	NPCBlacksmith: You can view your axe in your inventory by pressing "I". Safe exploring!
	do collect(axe)
do stop_talking()
do enable_movement()
=> END